intermediateSolutions -- option of trackPaths to get all intermediate solutions on a path
*****************************************************************************************

Description
===========

By default, when this option is false, on return are only the end points of
each solution path.

With this option set to true, on return are all intermediate solutions along a
path.  For large systems and/or complicated solution paths, the list on return
can be rather large.

