numericalIrreducibleDecomposition -- finds the irreducible components of the zero set of a system of polynomials
****************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        numericalIrreducibleDecomposition (system)
  * Inputs:
      * system, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a system of polynomials,
        with no more equations than indeterminates
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note StartDimension: numericalIrreducibleDecomposition_lp_pd_pd_pd_
        cmStartDimension=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, => ..., default value -1, Option to
        specify the dimension to begin searching for positive dimensional
        components
      * *note Verbose: numericalIrreducibleDecomposition_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmVerbose
        =>_pd_pd_pd_rp, => ..., default value false, option to specify whether
        additional output is wanted
  * Outputs:
      * a *note numerical variety: (NAGtypes)NumericalVariety,, containing a
        witness set for each irreducible component
  * Consequences:
      * This function calls *note cascade: cascade, and *note factorWitnessSet:
        factorWitnessSet,.

Description
===========

Given a list of generators of an ideal I, this function returns a *note
NumericalVariety: (NAGtypes)NumericalVariety, with a *note WitnessSet:
(NAGtypes)WitnessSet, for each irreducible component of V(I).



+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R=CC[x11,x22,x21,x12,x23,x13,x14,x24];                   |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : system={x11*x22-x21*x12,x12*x23-x22*x13,x13*x24-x23*x14};|
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : V=numericalIrreducibleDecomposition(system)              |
| -- setting random seed to 8                                  |
|found 7 irreducible factors                                   |
|                                                              |
|o3 = V                                                        |
|                                                              |
|o3 : NumericalVariety                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : WitSets=V#5; --witness sets are accessed by dimension    |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : w=first WitSets;                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : w.cache.IsIrreducible                                    |
|                                                              |
|o6 = true                                                     |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+



In the above example we found three components of dimension five, we can check
the solution using symbolic methods.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : R=QQ[x11,x22,x21,x12,x23,x13,x14,x24];                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : system={x11*x22-x21*x12,x12*x23-x22*x13,x13*x24-x23*x14};               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : PD=primaryDecomposition(ideal(system))                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = {ideal (x13, x23, x11*x22 - x21*x12), ideal (x12, x22, x23*x14 -        |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     x13*x24), ideal (x23*x14 - x13*x24, x21*x14 - x11*x24, x22*x14 -        |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     x12*x24, x12*x23 - x22*x13, x11*x23 - x21*x13, x11*x22 - x21*x12)}      |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
