File: PHCpack.info, Node: randomSeed, Next: realSlice1D, Prev: numThreads, Up: Top

randomSeed -- seed for the random number generators
***************************************************

Description
===========

To avoid singularities during complex path following, the homotopy methods use
a random constant. Different runs with solveSystem, trackPaths, or mixedVolume
(with StartSystem set to true) may therefore lead to the solutions listed in a
different order. Fixing the value of randomSeed leads to reproducible runs.

