searchDelta -- option of realSlice1D
************************************

Description
===========

In the line search we need to set the width of the search interval. After a
discretization, the golden section search method is applied to the interval [p
- searchDelta, p + searchDelta], where p is the point where the minimum value
after the discretization was found.

