File: PHCpack.info, Node: seeProgress, Next: solveRationalSystem, Prev: searchTolerance, Up: Top

seeProgress -- flag to monitor the progress of the multithreaded path tracker
*****************************************************************************

Description
===========

For a long path tracking job, one could check the progress of the computation
by checking the end of the output file. A multithreaded path tracker no longer
writes the solutions to the output file as soon as they are computed.  For path
tracking jobs that take a very long time, the lack of information on the
progress can be annoying.  With seeProgess turned on, every thread will write a
message to screen for each path tracking job.

Functions with optional argument named seeProgress:
===================================================

  * *note trackPaths(...,seeProgress=>...):
