StartSystem -- optional input to construct and solve a random coefficient system
********************************************************************************

Description
===========

Put StartSystem=>true as an argument in the function *note mixedVolume:
mixedVolume, to tell the method to use polyhedral homotopies.  Polyhedral
homotopies solve a system with the same Newton polytopes as the original system
and with random complex coefficients. This random coefficient system can serve
as a start system to solve the original input system.

